pro_course_detail.description:
If you have a job interview,
if you have a presentation need practicing,
if you just want to improve your communication skills with foreighners,
then this is your Perfect Choice!

In this course, I will walk you through different situations and topics in real-life business connections.
For example:
-Life work balance;
- Delegate tasks;
-Dealing with customers;
- Give feedback on performance;
- etc...

You will get
-Vocabulary in situations above;
- sentence structures to help you organize your ideas;
- more ideas.

最后的最后，这不仅是一堂英语课，更是一个能量交换场所，希望可以让大家have fun同时improve yourselves。
